    "description": "The A & D Mercury Model FS-30Ki is a Non Automatic Weighing Instrument of 30 kg maximum capacity. The instrument has the additional functionality of displaying 'LO/OK/HI' limits on the indicator for check weighing but this is not included in this approval. The instrument has a stainless steel weigh platform and a pole mounted backlit LCD display, a level bubble and four adjustable feet for levelling. The instrument may also work on a 6V sealed lead acid battery. The instrument has serial interface connectivity for providing connections to peripheral devices; the peripheral devices are not covered under this approval. The instrument was powered by mains power supply (220-240 V AC). The instrument has capabilities for tare and preset-tare (including pre-set tare values associated with product look-up tables)."
